{"id":"demasiado","lemma":"demasiado","pos":"adv","rank":187,"glosses":["too much, excessively, far too much, overmuch (modifying a verb)","too, far too, way too, much too, overly, all too excessively (modifying an adjective or other adverb)","a lot, an awful lot, a whole lot, a great deal"],"ipa":"/demaˈsjado/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-demasiado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo soy demasiado gordo.","en":"I'm too fat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438406"},{"text":"Yo era demasiado rápido.","en":"I was too fast.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440857"},{"text":"Yo era demasiado pequeño.","en":"I was too small.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441785"},{"text":"¿Es esto demasiado grande?","en":"Is this too big?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441935"},{"text":"Ella es demasiado débil.","en":"She is too weak.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442066"}]}